  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 579c9253f6a5be6499ca8a1851d07f90, type: 3}
  welcomeMessage: Welcome to Animal Sounds Quiz.
  letsLearnMessage: 'In this quiz, you''re going to choose the correct sound that
    is produced by the given animals. There will be 3 choices: A, B, and C. Press
    dot number 1 for A, dot number 2 for B, and dot number 3 for C.'
  completedMessage: Great Job! You finished Lesson 2 Animal Sounds.
  repeatQuestionMessage: Do you want to repeat again? Press repeat to repeat or Next
    to continue.
  lessonChoiceMessage: You have finished learning about animal sounds. Press repeat
    to repeat the lesson or press next to begin the quiz.
  lessonChoiceAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a91f4f2e06d82048a1bec8794a94244, type: 3}
  lessonPages:
  - title: 
    lessonText: Welcome to Lesson 2, Animal Sounds.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 07c88ca858526bb4e95592af2b38718f, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Now that you've learned some of the sounds you can here on your everyday
      life, lets be specific into learning what are the sounds produced by an animals.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d10e18940478e06409ab472bb847481d, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Animals make different sounds. These sounds help animals communicate
      with one another. We can also identify animals by listening carefully to the
      sounds they make.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d49ef0f243d9ae044a1260d3de23850b, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: For an example, Horses, Horses neighs.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ad81f3f3cf51f4a4f94afca86cb4f550, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Nneiggh
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da1935713bb5c2d4e9cdd705a4cb916f, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Goat bleets
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e2d51d1ff121f9641b300ff173e6c17a, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Meeee
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dce348faffb75614f8ffea2d5d28242f, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Cat Meows
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74610c52326ac2644a6bdf0a56957053, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Meow
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 789473d6f2023f44aba6ddb9c2eea13e, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Dog Barks
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6e44cee697282c44895ac4199e233149, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Arf-Arf
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb639cbad8fc65f4591dfe41c16820d2, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Cow Moos
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9b06fcae76989394fb1131257d49d40f, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Moooo
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91cc9825a3e7b2548b3fb222e8cf2581, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Or even birds sings.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ebcc16e894f0294bb4ed3d83eb55bb2, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Tweet-Tweet
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c928eea9a4d6ed746b88d734ec1b873e, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Every animal has its own special sound.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbe4359ee18198043bc43781f9ebbe53, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Sometimes we hear animals without seeing them. By listening carefully,
      we can tell which animal is nearby. Good listening helps us learn more about
      the world around us.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f813af262bee9b84fbda0adee6b23198, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Now you are ready to identify animal sounds. Good luck and have fun!
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9cffb759ae40064b9a6558ceacfd4b6, type: 3}
  lessons:
  - displayLabel: Horse
    categoryLabel: 'A. Meoow

      B. Meeee

      C. Neighh '
    promptMessage: Number 1 Horse, What do you think the sound produced by a horse?
    successMessage: That is correct.
    wrongMessage: Wrong Answer, Please Try again.
