    choiceCAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91cc9825a3e7b2548b3fb222e8cf2581, type: 3}
    supportMessage: Remember a dog barks. Press dot 1 for letter A, dot 2 for letter
      B, and dot 3 for letter C.
